<title>FRANCE: SOCCER-DEBBAH SIGNS FOUR-YEAR CONTRACT WITH ANDERLECHT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DEBBAH SIGNS FOUR-YEAR CONTRACT WITH ANDERLECHT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nice's Liberian international striker James Debbah has signed a four-year contract with Anderlecht, the French second division side said on Monday.</p>
<p>Debbah was recommended to the Belgian club by Enzo Scifo who moved from Monaco to Anderlecht this season.</p>
<p>The transfer fee was not officially disclosed but Nice sources said it was close to 10 million francs ($1.8 million).</p>
